clients\" class=\"clients\" id=\"clients\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"legacy-anchor\" id=\"clients-title\"></span><h2 class=\"quiet-heading\">Trusted by Irish businesses</h2><div class=\"marquee\"><div class=\"marquee-track logo-track\"><div class=\"marquee-group\"><a aria-label=\"Explore the VentSolve project\" data-track-id=\"cta-hrxzvx\" href=\"/case-studies/ventsolve-content-production/\"><div class=\"client-logo\"><img alt=\"VentSolve\" height=\"100\" src=\"/orbit/assets/ventsolve.webp\" width=\"200\"/></div></a><a aria-label=\"Explore the Perfect Clean project\" data-track-id=\"cta-1p97d8z\" href=\"/case-studies/perfect-clean-video-advertising/\"><div class=\"client-logo\"><img alt=\"Perfect Clean\" height=\"100\" src=\"/orbit/assets/perfect-clean.png\" width=\"200\"/></div></a><a aria-label=\"Explore the Gut Fest project\" data-track-id=\"orbit-426c2m\" href=\"/case-studies/gut-fest-event-videography-dublin/\"><div class=\"client-logo\"><img alt=\"Gut Fest\" height=\"100\" src=\"/orbit/assets/gut-fest.png\" width=\"200\"/></div></a><a aria-label=\"Explore the Leroy’s Barking World project\" data-track-id=\"cta-myrbik\" href=\"/case-studies/leroys-barking-world-social-content/\"><div class=\"client-logo\"><img alt=\"Leroy’s Barking World\" height=\"100\" src=\"/orbit/assets/leroys.png\" width=\"200\"/></div></a><a aria-label=\"Explore the Oxygen Chamber project\" data-track-id=\"orbit-14ye8xi\" href=\"/case-studies/amber-oxygen-therapy-video-production/\"><div class=\"client-logo\"><img alt=\"Oxygen Chamber\" height=\"100\" src=\"/images/clients/amber-oxygen.svg\" width=\"200\"/></div></a><a aria-label=\"Explore the Balbriggan Braces project\" data-track-id=\"cta-1adws6y\" href=\"/case-studies/balbriggan-braces-dental-videos/\"><div class=\"client-logo\"><img alt=\"Balbriggan Braces\" height=\"100\" src=\"/orbit/assets/balbriggan-braces.png\" width=\"200\"/></div></a><a aria-label=\"Explore the SG Studios Dublin project\" data-track-id=\"orbit-1ayootw\" href=\"/case-studies/sg-studios-dublin-podcast-studio-content/\"><div class=\"client-logo\"><img alt=\"SG Studios Dublin\" height=\"80\" src=\"/orbit/assets/sg-studios-logo.png\" width=\"240\"/></div></a></div></div></div></section>\n<section aria-label=\"Videos for our Irish clients\" aria-labelledby=\"client-films-title\" class=\"media-marquee\" data-measure-section=\"social-video-work\" id=\"work\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"legacy-anchor\" id=\"social-video-work-title\"></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"legacy-anchor\" id=\"social-video-work\"></span><header class=\"content-heading section-pad\"><h2 id=\"client-films-title\">Video production for Dublin and Irish businesses</h2><p>From North Dublin patient education to Dublin events and Irish service businesses. Watch our video work and explore the projects behind it.</p></header><div class=\"marquee\"><div class=\"marquee-track work-track\"><div class=\"marquee-group\"><button aria-label=\"Play VentSolve video\" class=\"work-tile\" data-track-id=\"orbit-1mf8foy\" data-video=\"ventsolve\"><img alt=\"VentSolve project by NextVision Studio\" height=\"1000\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/orbit/assets/ventsolve-installation.webp\" width=\"720\"/><span>VentSolve</span></button><noscript><a data-track-id=\"cta-81wii2\" href=\"/videos/portfolio-2026/ventsolve-installation.mp4\">Watch the VentSolve video</a></noscript><button aria-label=\"Play Perfect Clean video\" class=\"work-tile\" data-track-id=\"orbit-13ma8a6\" data-video=\"perfect-clean\"><img alt=\"Perfect Clean project by NextVision Studio\" height=\"1000\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/orbit/assets/perfect-clean-sink.webp\" width=\"720\"/><span>Perfect Clean</span></button><noscript><a data-track-id=\"cta-vrovii\" href=\"/videos/portfolio-2026/perfect-clean-sink.mp4\">Watch the Perfect Clean video</a></noscript><button aria-label=\"Play Gut Fest Dublin video\" class=\"work-tile\" data-track-id=\"orbit-18e1olc\" data-video=\"gut-fest\"><img alt=\"Gut Fest project by NextVision Studio\" height=\"1000\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/orbit/assets/JVA_WxYY3p0.webp\" width=\"720\"/><span>Gut Fest</span></button><noscript><a data-track-id=\"cta-qfq487\" href=\"/videos/case-studies/gut-fest.mp4\">Watch the Gut Fest Dublin video</a></noscript><button aria-label=\"Play Leroy’s Barking World video\" class=\"work-tile\" data-track-id=\"orbit-6dxr3u\" data-video=\"leroys\"><img alt=\"Leroy’s Barking World project by NextVision Studio\" height=\"1000\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/orbit/assets/53-_kK95Eoc.webp\" width=\"720\"/><span>Leroy’s Barking World</span></button><noscript><a data-track-id=\"cta-et5ael\" href=\"/videos/case-studies/leroys-barking-world.mp4\">Watch the Leroy’s Barking World video</a></noscript><button aria-label=\"Play Oxygen Chamber video\" class=\"work-tile\" data-track-id=\"orbit-v16fkn\" data-video=\"oxygen\"><img alt=\"Oxygen Chamber project by NextVision Studio\" height=\"1000\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/orbit/assets/amber-look-inside-poster.jpg\" width=\"720\"/><span>Oxygen Chamber</span></button><button aria-label=\"Play Balbriggan Braces video\" class=\"work-tile\" data-track-id=\"orbit-1xbke8p\" data-video=\"braces\"><img alt=\"Balbriggan Braces project by NextVision Studio\" height=\"1000\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/orbit/assets/braces-hot-drinks.webp\" width=\"720\"/><span>Balbriggan Braces</span></button><noscript><a data-track-id=\"cta-1qnxezw\" href=\"/videos/portfolio-2026/braces-hot-drinks.mp4\">Watch the Balbriggan Braces video</a></noscript><button aria-label=\"Play SG Studios Dublin short film\" class=\"work-tile\" data-track-id=\"orbit-1n4fqry\" data-video=\"sg-studios\"><img alt=\"SG Studios Dublin short-form film by NextVision Studio\" height=\"1280\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/orbit/assets/sg-studios-short.webp\" width=\"720\"/><span>SG Studios Dublin</span></button></div></div></div></section>\n<section class=\"about section-pad\" id=\"about\"><h2 class=\"outline-title\">ABOUT ME</h2><div class=\"about-copy\"><div><p>Your business.<br/><span>Impossible to ignore.</span></p><p class=\"body-copy\">I'm Peter, the filmmaker behind NextVision Studio. I turn what makes your business different into videos people want to watch. From the first idea to the final edit, I bring the story, the camera and the bigger picture.</p></div></div></section><section aria-label=\"NextVision Studio results\" class=\"ported-stats section-pad\" data-stats=\"\" id=\"results\"><dl class=\"stats__grid\"><div class=\"stats__item\" data-result-value=\"€10\"><dt>Average cost per lead from managed campaigns</dt><dd aria-label=\"€10 average cost per lead from managed campaigns\" class=\"stats__number\" data-counter=\"\" data-prefix=\"€\" data-start=\"100\" data-suffix=\"\" data-target=\"10\" title=\"€10\">€10</dd></div><div class=\"stats__item\" data-result-value=\"1,000,000+\"><dt>Video views across published client work</dt><dd aria-label=\"1,000,000+ video views across published client work\" class=\"stats__number\" data-counter=\"\" data-prefix=\"\" data-start=\"0\" data-suffix=\"+\" data-target=\"1000000\" title=\"1,000,000+\">1M+</dd></div><div class=\"stats__item\" data-result-value=\"€10,000+\"><dt>Ad spend managed for client campaigns</dt><dd aria-label=\"€10,000+ ad spend managed for client campaigns\" class=\"stats__number\" data-counter=\"\" data-prefix=\"€\" data-start=\"0\" data-suffix=\"+\" data-target=\"10000\" title=\"€10,000+\">€10K+</dd></div><div class=\"stats__item\" data-result-value=\"1,000+\"><dt>Social media content published</dt><dd aria-label=\"1,000+ social media content published\" class=\"stats__number\" data-counter=\"\" data-prefix=\"\" data-start=\"0\" data-suffix=\"+\" data-target=\"1000\" title=\"1,000+\">1K+</dd></div></dl></section>__ORBIT_MONTHLY_PACKAGES__\n<section aria-labelledby=\"workflow-title\" class=\"workflow section-pad\" data-measure-section=\"how-we-work\" id=\"workflow\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"legacy-anchor\" id=\"process-title\"></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-alias\" id=\"how-we-work\"></span><div class=\"workflow-stage\"><h2 id=\"workflow-title\">WE SEE THE<br/><span>WHOLE PICTURE.</span></h2><p class=\"workflow-intro\">We can help shape the full path: useful content, well-planned advertising and a clear way to handle the enquiries it creates. Start at the stage your business needs most.</p><ol class=\"workflow-rail\"><li><button class=\"step-button\" data-goto-step=\"0\" data-track-id=\"orbit-1h4tnsb\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"step-dot\"></span><span>Idea</span></button></li><li><button class=\"step-button\" data-goto-step=\"1\" data-track-id=\"orbit-nb9usk\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"step-dot\"></span><span>Shoot</span></button></li><li><button class=\"step-button\" data-goto-step=\"2\" data-track-id=\"orbit-1sly7eq\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"step-dot\"></span><span>Edit</span></button></li><li><button class=\"step-button\" data-goto-step=\"3\" data-track-id=\"orbit-o94wjn\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"step-dot\"></span><span>Post</span></button></li><li><button class=\"step-button\" data-goto-step=\"4\" data-track-id=\"orbit-1thzbq2\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"step-dot\"></span><span>Ads</span></button></li><li><button class=\"step-button\" data-goto-step=\"5\" data-track-id=\"orbit-1ytd5ib\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"step-dot\"></span><span>CRM</span></button></li></ol><div class=\"workflow-slides\"><div aria-hidden=\"false\" class=\"workflow-slide\" data-step=\"0\"><span class=\"workflow-number\">01</span><div class=\"workflow-word\"><h3>IDEA</h3><p>Start with the right story.</p><p class=\"workflow-description\">We find the message, the audience and what the content needs to do.</p></div></div><div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"workflow-slide\" data-step=\"1\"><span class=\"workflow-number\">02</span><div class=\"workflow-word\"><h3>SHOOT</h3><p>Make the idea real.</p><p class=\"workflow-scope\">Video and photography</p><p class=\"workflow-description\">Create clear, useful content that shows what you do and gives people a reason to remember you.</p><nav aria-label=\"Video and photography services\" class=\"workflow-links\"><a data-track-id=\"cta-1f0voqz\" href=\"/short-form-video-production-dublin/\">Videography</a><a data-track-id=\"cta-om6o6s\" href=\"/photography-dublin/\">Photography</a></nav></div></div><div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"workflow-slide\" data-step=\"2\"><span class=\"workflow-number\">03</span><div class=\"workflow-word\"><h3>EDIT</h3><p>Give every frame a purpose.</p><p class=\"workflow-description\">Pacing, sound, captions and a clear story, shaped for each channel.</p></div></div><div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"workflow-slide\" data-step=\"3\"><span class=\"workflow-number\">04</span><div class=\"workflow-word\"><h3>POST</h3><p>Put the work in front of people.</p><p class=\"workflow-description\">Plan the content, prepare the posts and publish to the agreed channels.</p></div></div><div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"workflow-slide\" data-step=\"4\"><span class=\"workflow-number\">05</span><div class=\"workflow-word\"><h3>ADS</h3><p>Reach the right audience.</p><p class=\"workflow-scope\">Google and Meta ads</p><p class=\"workflow-description\">Put the strongest message in front of a relevant audience, then measure the enquiries that follow.</p><nav aria-label=\"Google and Meta ads services\" class=\"workflow-links\"><a data-track-id=\"cta-1numtpn\" href=\"/google-ads-meta-ads-dublin/\">Advertising</a></nav></div></div><div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"workflow-slide\" data-step=\"5\"><span class=\"workflow-number\">06</span><div class=\"workflow-word\"><h3>CRM</h3><p>Make the next step count.</p><p class=\"workflow-scope\">CRM and automation</p><p class=\"workflow-description\">Keep new enquiries in one clear process, with useful next steps for your team and timely follow-up for customers.</p><nav aria-label=\"CRM and automation services\" class=\"workflow-links\"><a data-track-id=\"cta-kytme3\" href=\"/crm-lead-automation-dublin/\">CRM and lead automation</a></nav></div></div><div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"workflow-orbit\"><div class=\"orbit-track\"></div><div class=\"orbit-inner\"></div><div class=\"orbit-rotor\"><span class=\"orbit-bead\"></span><svg class=\"orbit-arc\" viewbox=\"0 0 100 100\"><circle cx=\"50\" cy=\"50\" r=\"49\"></circle></svg></div><div class=\"orbit-core\"><svg class=\"workflow-icon is-current\" data-icon=\"0\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M9 18h6M10 21h4M8.5 14.5a6 6 0 1 1 7 0c-1 .8-1.5 1.5-1.5 3.5h-4c0-2-.5-2.7-1.5-3.5Z\"></path></svg><svg class=\"workflow-icon\" data-icon=\"1\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M8 6 9.5 4h5L16 6h3a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v10a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h3Z\"></path><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"13\" r=\"4\"></circle></svg><svg class=\"workflow-icon\" data-icon=\"2\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M4 6h6M14 6h6M4 12h2M10 12h10M4 18h10M18 18h2\"></path><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"6\" r=\"2\"></circle><circle cx=\"8\" cy=\"12\" r=\"2\"></circle><circle cx=\"16\" cy=\"18\" r=\"2\"></circle></svg><svg class=\"workflow-icon\" data-icon=\"3\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><rect height=\"16\" rx=\"3\" width=\"18\" x=\"3\" y=\"5\"></rect><path d=\"M7 3v4M17 3v4M3 10h18M8 14h2M14 14h2M8 17h2\"></path></svg><svg class=\"workflow-icon\" data-icon=\"4\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"m14 5 6-2v16l-6-2H6a3 3 0 0 1-3-3v-4a3 3 0 0 1 3-3h8V5ZM14 7v10M6 17l1 4h4l-1-4\"></path></svg><svg class=\"workflow-icon\" data-icon=\"5\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><rect height=\"18\" rx=\"3\" width=\"18\" x=\"3\" y=\"3\"></rect><circle cx=\"9\" cy=\"9\" r=\"2\"></circle><path d=\"M5.5 16c0-4 7-4 7 0M15 8h3M15 12h3M15 16h2\"></path></svg></div></div></div><div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"workflow-progress\"><span></span></div><p class=\"workflow-note\">Already have content, ads or a CRM? We can begin with the part that needs attention.</p></div></section>\n<section class=\"services section-pad\" id=\"services\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"legacy-anchor\" id=\"services-title\"></span><h2 class=\"service-heading\">Our Services, Made to a Higher Standard</h2><div class=\"services__intro\"><p>In a crowded market, quality video is a real advantage. Short-form clips and business videos help people understand your business and trust what you offer.</p><p>We plan, film and edit videos for Dublin businesses, then help you use them on your website and in ads to bring in enquiries. Every project starts with a clear goal.</p></div><div class=\"service-list\"><details><summary><span class=\"service-number\">01</span><h3>Short Form Video Production</h3><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"service-icon\">+</span></summary><div class=\"service-content\"><p>Turn one filming day into a library of videos that keeps your business visible across social media.</p><p>Reels, TikToks and YouTube Shorts that show what makes your business worth noticing. We shape the ideas, plan the shoot and guide you on camera, then edit the footage into a clear set of videos. Formats, captions and final deliverables are agreed around the channels you actually use.</p><ul><li>Plan ideas for the people you want to reach.</li><li>Film several videos in one visit.</li><li>Get edits ready for Instagram, TikTok and YouTube.</li></ul><a class=\"text-link\" data-track-id=\"orbit-1wnt8fi\" href=\"/short-form-video-production-dublin/\">Explore Short Form Video Production</a></div></details><details><summary><span class=\"service-number\">02</span><h3>Corporate Video Production</h3><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"service-icon\">+</span></summary><div class=\"service-content\"><p>Explain your service, train your team or share a customer story with a clear, professional video.</p><p>Help people understand your business through the people who know it best. We plan and produce interviews, service explainers, customer stories and training films around a clear message. From the first conversation to the final edit, the production is shaped around your audience and where the finished film will be used.</p><ul><li>Service explainers and customer stories.</li><li>Interviews and training videos.</li><li>Edits sized for your website and sales calls.</li></ul><a class=\"text-link\" data-track-id=\"orbit-1e6032c\" href=\"/corporate-video-production-dublin/\">Explore Corporate Video Production</a></div></details><details><summary><span class=\"service-number\">03</span><h3>Event Videography</h3><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"service-icon\">+</span></summary><div class=\"service-content\"><p>Turn a conference, launch or live performance into a highlight film and social edits you can keep using.</p><p>Keep the atmosphere of your event alive after the day is over. We plan around the schedule, capture the people and details, and make room for the moments you cannot stage. Highlight films, interviews and shorter social edits can be agreed together so the footage has a clear purpose afterwards.</p><ul><li>Plan the moments that matter before the day.</li><li>Film the room, the speakers and the people.</li><li>Get a highlight film plus short social cuts.</li></ul><a class=\"text-link\" data-track-id=\"orbit-iwvh4\" href=\"/event-videographer-dublin/\">Explore Event Videography</a></div></details><details><summary><span class=\"service-number\">04</span><h3>Monthly Social Media Content</h3><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"service-icon\">+</span></summary><div class=\"service-content\"><p>Build a consistent library of video and photography without starting from scratch every week. We plan topics around your business, organise regular filming and prepare a useful mix of finished content. The filming schedule, number of pieces and any support with posting are agreed before we begin.</p><a class=\"text-link\" data-track-id=\"orbit-14zgxcn\" href=\"/social-media-content-creation-dublin/\">Explore Monthly Social Media Content</a></div></details><details><summary><span class=\"service-number\">05</span><h3>Google and Meta Ads Management</h3><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"service-icon\">+</span></summary><div class=\"service-content\"><p>Put your videos in front of the right people in Dublin with campaigns measured by enquiries.</p><p>Put a clear message in front of a relevant audience across Google, Facebook and Instagram. We connect campaign planning with the right creative, landing page and enquiry tracking. Ongoing management focuses on what the data shows, with the campaign scope, advertising budget and reporting agreed around your business.</p><ul><li>Campaigns built around your videos and offers.</li><li>Google Ads and Meta Ads managed together.</li><li>Simple reporting on enquiries, not just clicks.</li></ul><a class=\"text-link\" data-track-id=\"orbit-1w0pmie\" href=\"/google-ads-meta-ads-dublin/\">Explore Google and Meta Ads Management</a></div></details><details><summary><span class=\"service-number\">06</span><h3>Commercial Photography</h3><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"service-icon\">+</span></summary><div class=\"service-content\"><p>Original photographs of your people, products and workplace, ready for your website and social channels.</p><p>Show the real people, products and places behind your business. We plan the photographs around how you will use them, whether that is a website, a campaign or everyday social content. Lighting, location and image selection are considered together so the finished collection feels consistent and useful.</p><ul><li>Product, team and workplace photography.</li><li>Plan photographs alongside your video shoot.</li><li>Receive selected, edited images ready to use.</li></ul><a class=\"text-link\" data-track-id=\"orbit-1hgd2a\" href=\"/photography-dublin/\">Explore Commercial Photography</a></div></details><details><summary><span class=\"service-number\">07</span><h3>Website Design and Development</h3><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"service-icon\">+</span></summary><div class=\"service-content\"><p>Give your videos a home that makes it easy for people to understand what you offer and get in touch.</p><p>Give your business a website that is easy to understand and easy to use. We organise the content, design for desktop and mobile, and make the next step clear for visitors. Your work, services and contact options are brought together in a structure that supports how you actually do business.</p><ul><li>A clear layout for phones and computers.</li><li>Simple pages that answer customer questions.</li><li>Easy ways for visitors to contact you.</li></ul><a class=\"text-link\" data-track-id=\"orbit-101n15z\" href=\"/webdesigner-dublin/\">Explore Website Design and Development</a></div></details><details><summary><span class=\"service-number\">08</span><h3>CRM and AI Automation</h3><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"service-icon\">+</span></summary><div class=\"service-content\"><p>Keep enquiries organised and make follow-up easier with CRM workflows and practical AI automation.</p><p>Keep new enquiries moving through one clear process instead of getting lost across different tools. We connect forms, organise customer information and build useful follow up automations around your workflow. The aim is a system your team can understand, with the right information available when the next action is due.</p><ul><li>Capture enquiries in one organised pipeline.</li><li>Set up reminders and follow-up workflows.</li><li>Automate repeat tasks where it helps your business.</li></ul><a class=\"text-link\" data-track-id=\"orbit-2g3vw5\" href=\"/crm-lead-automation-dublin/\">Explore CRM and AI Automation</a></div></details></div></section>\n<section class=\"projects section-pad\" data-measure-section=\"portfolio\" id=\"projects\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"legacy-anchor\" id=\"home-work-title\"></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-alias\" id=\"portfolio\"></span><h2 class=\"outline-title\">PROJECTS</h2><a class=\"project-index-link\" data-track-id=\"cta-1m8ti88\" href=\"/case-studies/\">View all case studies</a><div class=\"project-stack\"><article class=\"project\" id=\"project-ventsolve\" style=\"--i:0\">\n<div class=\"project-top\"><span class=\"project-number\">01</span><div class=\"project-name\"><h3>VentSolve</h3><p>Service and brand video production for an Irish business.</p></div><button class=\"pill\" data-track-id=\"orbit-10rbwbw\" data-video=\"ventsolve\">PLAY PROJECT</button></div>\n<div class=\"project-media\"><button aria-label=\"Watch VentSolve video\" data-track-id=\"orbit-e84n71\" data-video=\"ventsolve\"><img alt=\"VentSolve video by NextVision Studio\" height=\"1000\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/orbit/assets/ventsolve-installation.webp\" width=\"720\"/><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"play-mark\">▶</span></button><img alt=\"Another view from the VentSolve project\" height=\"1000\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/orbit/assets/fLzjvPVHzAc.webp\" width=\"720\"/></div>\n<p class=\"project-summary\">Brand, educational and campaign video used across the customer journey.</p><div class=\"project-more\"><button data-clip=\"0\" data-track-id=\"cta-al3hkq\" data-video=\"ventsolve\" type=\"button\">Ventilation installation</button><button data-clip=\"1\" data-track-id=\"cta-zahh09\" data-video=\"ventsolve\" type=\"button\">On site with VentSolve</button><button data-clip=\"2\" data-track-id=\"cta-d2fzrf\" data-video=\"ventsolve\" type=\"button\">VentSolve in Milan</button><a data-track-id=\"orbit-1c5otdy\" href=\"/case-studies/ventsolve-content-production/\">Explore the VentSolve project</a></div></article><article class=\"project\" id=\"project-perfect-clean\" style=\"--i:1\">\n<div class=\"project-top\"><span class=\"project-number\">02</span><div class=\"project-name\"><h3>Perfect Clean</h3><p>Owner-led video content for an Irish cleaning business.</p></div><button class=\"pill\" data-track-id=\"orbit-d1yz70\" data-video=\"perfect-clean\">PLAY PROJECT</button></div>\n<div class=\"project-media\"><button aria-label=\